msgstr "[演算子表現の設計原則](operators#operators-explanation)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Group operator terms: use the operator structure](grouping#grouping-explanation)\n"
msgstr "[演算子の項をグループ化する：演算子の構造を使う](grouping#grouping-explanation)\n"

