# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Guides explaining how a [`BosonicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-bosonic-circuit#qiskit_bosons.circuit.BosonicCircuit \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.BosonicCircuit\") becomes a [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit), and how to control the Trotter error along the way.\n"
msgstr "[`BosonicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-bosonic-circuit#qiskit_bosons.circuit.BosonicCircuit \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.BosonicCircuit\") が [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit) になる仕組みと、その過程でトロッター誤差を制御する方法を説明するガイドです。\n"

